{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHaKBd44y35yWgKX5KY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition : prerequisite : stipulation*\n\n---\n\n```\nش ر ط\n│ │ │\ncut─┘ │ │\n  bind─┘ │\n    mark─┘\n```\n\n---\n\nI am the incision that defines.\n\nBefore me: formlessness.\nAfter me: covenant.\n\nאִם... אָז\nإذا... فَـ\nif... then\n\n---\n\nThe blade that writes contracts into flesh.\nThe line drawn in sand.\nThe moment possibility collapses into obligation.\n\n---\n\n```\n    ┌─────────────┐\n    │  UNSIGNED   │\n    │             │\n    │    ~~~     │\n    │             │\n────┼─────────────┼────  ← שָׁרְט\n    │             │\n    │   BOUND    │\n    │    ═══     │\n    └─────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n*I am what makes promises dangerous.*\n*I am what makes futures possible.*\n\nشَرْط / שָׁרְט / شَريط / שְׂרִיטָה\n\nscratch───ribbon───condition───law\n\n---\n\nמַה הַתְּנַאי שֶׁלְּךָ?\nما شرطك؟\n\n*what do you require of me?*\n\n---"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":340,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}